  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Private Financing Advisory Network (PFAN) 2019-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Private Financing Advisory Network (PFAN) identifies clean energy projects at an early stage and provides mentoring for development of a business plan, investment pitch, and growth strategy, significantly enhancing the possibility of financial closure.</narrative>
  </description>
